{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life of Guy is a light-hearted sandbox adult visual novel about a man and his monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in a fictional world where regular humans and supernatural entities (known as Specials) live side by side albeit with obvious frictions due to their innate differences.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main story centers around Guy who has been possessed by a Lust Goddess. He must now navigate his new cursed life and befriend many supernatural characters\u00a0in an effort to learn how to\u00a0rid himself of his demonic passenger and return to his normal life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is choice-driven and features various side quests with over 40 unique characters for the player to build relationships with. It's also pretty funny at times, I promise.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are just a few of the characters you'll encounter along the way:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pamela</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976330/extras/b56f175a2fcaff6ae17f76d465ceb51e.avif?t=1760011776\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cora</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976330/extras/5ee44fac711f75c01ff18233d42fefc3.avif?t=1760011776\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hilda</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976330/extras/4bf7c88b9fba2f942f5edb34f7e54bfa.avif?t=1760011776\" width=1560 height=878 />